{"meta":{"id":"skills","category":"portfolio","title":"보유 기술 (Skill Inventory)","subtitle":"","summary":"실무 프로젝트 및 코드 검증 기반 핵심 역량 — Backend(Java/Spring, Python/FastAPI), Database(PostgreSQL, Oracle, DuckDB/Parquet), Data Pipeline, Frontend, DevOps, Systems(C++ MFC, OpenCV), AI Agent","tags":["java","spring","fastapi","python","postgresql","oracle","duckdb","parquet","redis","docker","c++","opencv","ai","보안"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"portfolio","updatedAt":"2026-11-07"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\">\r\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>PORTFOLIO\r\n    </span>\r\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2026-11-07</span>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">보유 기술 (Skill Inventory)</h1>\r\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\">\r\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\r\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\r\n    </svg>\r\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\r\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 실무 프로젝트 및 코드 검증 기반 핵심 역량 — Backend(Java/Spring, Python/FastAPI), Database(PostgreSQL, Oracle, DuckDB/Parquet), Data Pipeline, Frontend, DevOps, Systems(C++ MFC, OpenCV), AI Agent\r\n    </p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">1. 기술 수준 요약 (Skill Level Matrix)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white my-2\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">구분</th><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">주력 기술 (Core / Production)</th><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">실무 활용 (Proficient)</th><th class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 whitespace-nowrap\">경험 및 연구 (Familiar)</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>Backend</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>Java (8/11/21)</strong>, <strong class='text-stone-900'>Spring Boot</strong>, 전자정부프레임워크, MyBatis</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Python (FastAPI, Flask), Node.js (Express, NestJS)</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Firebase Functions</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>Database</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>PostgreSQL</strong>, <strong class='text-stone-900'>Oracle</strong>, <strong class='text-stone-900'>DuckDB / Parquet</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Redis, MySQL, DynamoDB</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">MongoDB, ChromaDB, Qdrant</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>Data & Pipeline</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>SQL 쿼리 최적화</strong>, <strong class='text-stone-900'>대용량 데이터 로딩·압축</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Polars, Pandas, PyArrow, ETL 스크립트</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">BGE-M3 임베딩, RAG 파이프라인</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>Frontend</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>JSP / JSTL</strong>, <strong class='text-stone-900'>jQuery</strong>, JavaScript (ES6+)</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">React (Next.js, Vite), Plotly, ECharts, Electron</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Vue.js</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>DevOps / Infra</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>Linux (Ubuntu, CentOS)</strong>, <strong class='text-stone-900'>Docker</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Nginx (리버스 프록시 / SSL), Tomcat, Shell Script</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">AWS (CloudFormation, Lambda)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>Embedded / Systems</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>C++ (MFC, Win32 API)</strong>, <strong class='text-stone-900'>멀티스레드 IPC</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">OpenCV (영상처리), OpenGL (3D 렌더링)</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">C# (.NET WinForms)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>AI & Prompting</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>Claude Code</strong>, <strong class='text-stone-900'>AI 에이전트 작업 체계(규칙·컨텍스트)</strong></td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">OpenAI API (Structured Outputs), 프롬프트 A/B 검증</td><td class=\"py-2.5 px-3.5 align-top text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">임베딩 벡터 적재</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">2.1 백엔드 및 아키텍처 (Backend &amp; Architecture)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 space-y-2\">\r\n  <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 tracking-wide mb-1.5\">2.1 Backend &amp; Architecture</h3>\r\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5\">\r\n    <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Java &amp; Spring Ecosystem (Core)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• <strong class='text-stone-900'>Spring Boot / Spring MVC</strong>: 레이어드 아키텍처(Controller-Service-DAO/Repository) 기반 백엔드 설계 및 구축<br/>• <strong class='text-stone-900'>전자정부 표준프레임워크</strong>: 공공기관 표준 아키텍처 환경에서의 대규모 서비스 유지보수 및 신규 모듈 개발<br/>• <strong class='text-stone-900'>MyBatis & JPA</strong>: 복잡한 동적 쿼리(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>if</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>choose</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>foreach</code>) 매퍼 설계, 대량 데이터 배치 처리 및 엔티티 연관관계 설계<br/>• <strong class='text-stone-900'>보안 및 인증 인터셉터</strong>: 세션 하이재킹 방어, 중복 로그인 방지, API 요청 해시 검증 인터셉터 구현</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Python Backend (Proficient)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• <strong class='text-stone-900'>FastAPI & Flask</strong>: 경량 마이크로서비스 백엔드 및 비동기 처리 API 서버 구축<br/>• <strong class='text-stone-900'>APScheduler & 비동기 큐</strong>: 시스템 리소스 상태 모니터링, 주기적 캐시 갱신 및 임시 파일 정리 백그라운드 워커 운영</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Node.js Ecosystem (Proficient)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• <strong class='text-stone-900'>Express & NestJS</strong>: TypeScript 기반 모듈형 마이크로서비스 및 RESTful API 서버 구축 경험</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">2.2 데이터베이스 및 데이터 엔지니어링 (Database &amp; Data)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 space-y-2\">\r\n  <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 tracking-wide mb-1.5\">2.2 Database &amp; Data Engineering</h3>\r\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5\">\r\n    <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>RDBMS — PostgreSQL &amp; Oracle (Core)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• 대용량 데이터 분석을 위한 복잡한 SQL 작성 (계층형 쿼리, 분석 윈도우 함수, CTE 최적화)<br/>• 대민 연계 서비스의 알림 스케줄러 쿼리 및 대량 트랜잭션 튜닝<br/>• 시스템 카탈로그 및 인덱스 구조를 고려한 쿼리 플랜(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code>) 분석 및 최적화</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>OLAP &amp; Columnar Storage — DuckDB / Parquet (Core)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• 1,100만 건 이상의 시계열/구급상황 데이터를 대상으로 한 분석 워크로드 고속화 실증<br/>• Parquet 압축(zstd/snappy) 및 Row Group 설정을 통한 디스크 I/O 최적화 및 쿼리 속도 대폭 개선</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>In-Memory &amp; NoSQL — Redis / DynamoDB (Proficient)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• Redis를 활용한 무거운 통계 분석 결과 캐싱, 분산 락(Lock) 및 작업 상태 관리<br/>• DynamoDB 비정형 데이터 모델링 및 AWS SDK 연동 경험</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Data Processing — Polars / PyArrow (Proficient)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• Polars 스트리밍 지연 연산(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>sink_parquet</code>)을 활용한 메모리 제한(OOM 방지) 대용량 ETL 파이프라인 구현</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">2.3 프론트엔드 및 데이터 시각화 (Frontend &amp; Visualization)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 space-y-2\">\r\n  <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 tracking-wide mb-1.5\">2.3 Frontend &amp; Data Visualization</h3>\r\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5\">\r\n    <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Data Visualization — Plotly / ECharts (Proficient)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• 분석 서버와 연계된 동적 차트 생성 (버블 차트, 분포도, 상위 통계 자동 필터링 및 '기타' 그룹화)<br/>• 웹 화면에서 비동기 데이터 로딩을 통한 반응형 데이터 대시보드 구현</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Web Frontend — React / JSP / WebSquare\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• JSP/jQuery 기반 레거시 및 공공 시스템 화면 개발, WebSquare 그리드 컴포넌트 연동<br/>• Next.js 및 Vite 환경의 모던 React SPA 화면 개발 역량</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Desktop Dashboard — Electron (Proficient)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• Electron 기반 시스템 트레이 통합 개발 환경 도구 구현 경험</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">2.4 데브옵스 및 보안 (DevOps &amp; Security)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 space-y-2\">\r\n  <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 tracking-wide mb-1.5\">2.4 DevOps &amp; Security</h3>\r\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5\">\r\n    <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Server &amp; Container (Core / Proficient)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• Linux 서버 환경에서의 독립 가상환경 배포, 무중단 데몬 관리 및 기동/종료 쉘 스크립트 작성<br/>• Docker 및 Docker Compose를 활용한 멀티 컨테이너 환경(백엔드, DB, Nginx, Redis) 구성 및 경량 이미지 빌드<br/>• Nginx 리버스 프록시 구성 및 Let's Encrypt SSL/TLS 인증서 자동 갱신 체계 운영</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Application &amp; Server Security (Proficient)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• 웹 취약점 대응 (세션 탈취 차단, 매크로/반복 호출 방어, 권한 검증)<br/>• SSH 하드닝(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>Match</code> 블록 분리), 취약 라이브러리 판정 및 안전한 패치/롤백 절차 수립</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">2.5 시스템 및 비전 SW (Systems &amp; Embedded Vision)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 space-y-2\">\r\n  <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 tracking-wide mb-1.5\">2.5 Systems &amp; Embedded Vision (C/C++)</h3>\r\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5\">\r\n    <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>C++ MFC &amp; Win32 API (Core)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• 고정밀 제조 장비(레이저 가공기, 디스플레이 검사기) 제어 데스크톱 소프트웨어 개발<br/>• Windows 공유 메모리(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>CreateFileMapping</code>) 기반 프로세스 간 초고속 영상 데이터 IPC 구현<br/>• 15개 작업자 스레드 분할 병렬 렌더링을 통한 UI 응답성 확보</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Computer Vision &amp; Graphics — OpenCV / OpenGL (Proficient)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• 카메라 캘리브레이션, 에지/마크 검출, 서브픽셀 라인 정합 알고리즘 구현<br/>• AutoCAD DXF 파일 파싱을 통한 3D 가공 경로 OpenGL 렌더링</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">2.6 AI 에이전트 엔지니어링 및 생산성 체계화</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 space-y-2\">\r\n  <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 tracking-wide mb-1.5\">2.6 AI Agent Engineering &amp; Productivity</h3>\r\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5\">\r\n    <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>AI Context &amp; Knowledge Base Architecture (Core)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• LLM 코딩 에이전트(Claude Code, Antigravity 등)가 대규모 코드베이스에서 규칙을 준수하도록 하는 지식 베이스(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-100 text-stone-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-stone-200'>aide</code>) 및 상시 규칙 표준화<br/>• 프로젝트 간 공통 규칙을 계층적으로 상속시키는 컨텍스트 엔지니어링 수행</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>Reliable Prompting — Structured Outputs (Proficient)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• OpenAI API 및 최신 모델을 활용한 strict JSON 스키마 기반 데이터 추출 및 융합 추천<br/>• 프롬프트 A/B 벤치마킹을 통한 환각 억제 및 결과 재현성 확보</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-stone-50/70 border border-stone-200/70 space-y-1\">\r\n  <div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2\">\r\n    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>사용량 및 성과 분석 자동화 (Core)\r\n  </div>\r\n  <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3.5\">• 로컬 AI 실행 로그를 파싱/집계하는 분석 도구를 직접 구축하여 AI 협업 생산성 측정</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n","path":"portfolio/skills","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"portfolio","title":"포트폴리오","path":"portfolio"}],"hasImage":false}